**🗣️ Trả lời EN (~60s):**
> Honest gaps I'd flag upfront. **EAS Build for production** and **NativeWind** — I've worked with both on a demo project, not yet in production. The core mental model is identical to what I've shipped (CodePush, theme tokens), so ramp-up should take days, not weeks. **Push notifications end-to-end** — I understand the APNs/FCM/Expo architecture, but I haven't owned the full backend campaign side at Firegroup. **SQLite offline-write at scale** — I know the pattern but haven't shipped a large offline-first feature. For these I'd pair with the team to scope sprint 1 properly. What I have shipped in production: TypeScript, TanStack Query, Redux Toolkit, performance optimization, FlatList tuning, auth with SecureStore, App Store and Play releases, modular architecture. I'm not pretending to be a native iOS/Android senior — I deliver RN features fast and learn the rest on the job.

**🗣️ Trả lời VN (~60s):**
> Honest gap em muốn flag trước. **EAS Build production** và **NativeWind** — em đã làm trên demo, chưa ship production. Mental model giống cái em đã ship (CodePush, theme tokens) nên ramp vài ngày, không vài tuần. **Push end-to-end** — em hiểu kiến trúc APNs/FCM/Expo, nhưng chưa own toàn bộ backend campaign ở Firegroup. **SQLite offline-write scale lớn** em chưa ship. Mấy thứ này em sẽ pair với team scope sprint 1. Cái em đã ship production: TypeScript, TanStack Query, Redux Toolkit, performance, FlatList, auth SecureStore, App Store/Play release, modular architecture. Em không pretend là native senior — em deliver RN feature nhanh và learn phần còn lại on the job.

**Vì sao trả lời thế này là điểm cộng:**
- Senior interviewer rất ghét candidate over-claim. Honest gap + plan ramp = credible.
- Pattern **"có gap" + "đã có mental model tương tự" + "sẽ pair với team"** show maturity.

